      "descriptions": {
        "shortDescriptionText": "<p>Virtually try on an Iron Man suit yourself! Learn how to control the Repulsors, then fire away at Hulk, and at an army of enemies to protect the city!</p>",
        "shortDescriptionMobileText": "Virtually try on an Iron Man suit yourself! Learn how to control the Repulsors, then fire away at Hulk, and at an army of enemies to protect the city!\n"
      },
      "entityCards": [
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "Inside the Marvel Cinematic Universe",
              "text": "<p>Discover the expansive universe that houses some of the world’s greatest Super Heroes! All of these brave champions occupy the stratosphere of the Marvel Cinematic Universe—and have their roots in Marvel Comics.</p>\n<p>Here are some of the films they star in, which are all part of the Marvel Cinematic Universe:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Marvel’s Iron Man</em></li>\n<li><em>Marvel’s Iron Man 2</em></li>\n<li><em>Marvel’s Thor</em></li>\n<li><em>Marvel’s Captain America: The First Avenger</em></li>\n<li><em>Marvel’s The Avengers</em></li>\n<li><em>Marvel’s Iron Man 3</em></li>\n<li><em>Marvel’s Thor: The Dark World</em></li>\n<li><em>Marvel’s Captain America: The Winter Soldier</em></li>\n<li><em>Marvel’s Guardians of the Galaxy</em></li>\n<li><em>Marvel’s Avengers: Age of Ultron</em></li>\n<li><em>Marvel’s Ant-Man</em></li>\n<li><em>Marvel’s Captain America: Civil War</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Marvel Cinematic Universe roster will also introduce some new movies that are currently being filmed or are in development, including <em>Marvel’s Doctor Strange</em>. The entire slate of new films will be in movie theaters for you to see—with release dates scheduled from 2016 to 2019!</p>\n<p>Explore this collection of extraordinary entertainment when you visit the <a href=\"https://www.shanghaidisneyresort.com/en/attractions/marvel-universe/\">Marvel Universe</a> at Shanghai Disneyland!</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-marvel-universe-02-new_tcm1871-115156.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
